      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RINGSIDE ATLAS (1) raced close the lead throughout and overcame a bump to score (22.15) at this track over 381m in a Novice race last time. Has the ability and expected to go close again. JUMP ON KNOTS (8) was an impressive winner last time, overcoming a collision in the run to score by 3 lengths in a Maiden over 381m at this track. Harder here but expected to measure up. GO GETTEM CHIVAS (5) was strongly fancied but finished second last time (22.28) at this track, bringing a two-run winning streak to an end. Form is hard to fault from this box, with a win and two minor placings from three starts. Winning chance. TOOTH KEEPING (2) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
